{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ware's Laboratory is a horror game inspired by creepypasta about famous titles of the past. Explore surreal atmospheric levels, find notes from a mysterious developer who built this hellish place, take back control of your laboratory, and bond with your research team to face the unknown together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967510/extras/4b0cb54b10db187f5b9c8ce14c2eef31.poster.avif?t=1768831684\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967510/extras/4b0cb54b10db187f5b9c8ce14c2eef31.webm?t=1768831684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive laboratory filled with <strong>deadly horrors</strong> and <strong>unique challenges</strong>. Navigate in changing layouts, survive in glitchy environments, and try to spot the monster before it finds YOU.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric scares</strong> based on creepypasta. Those old urban legends about haunted games are now true!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Several layers of narrative</strong>\u00a0woven into a complex story. Uncover the mysteries of MHD in multiple realities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>original soundtrack</strong> tailor-made to <strong>minimize your comfort</strong>.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967510?t=1768831684","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967510/3b9e5b739a6932560b496a7d38463a21fba19c5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768831684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat